 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "授权书",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 90.45,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.232,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "账户抽象，是让合约代码来决定，账户怎么验证、怎么执行。",
   "spoken": "账户抽象，是让合约代码来决定，账户怎么验证、怎么执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.052,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 4.15,
   "speechEnd": 9.352
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "协议不再写死，一把私钥签一笔交易。",
   "spoken": "协议不再写死，一把私钥签一笔交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.416,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 10.514,
   "speechEnd": 13.18
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "打个比方。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 14.236,
   "dur": 1.872,
   "speechStart": 14.334,
   "speechEnd": 15.119
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "以前去银行，每笔转账都要本人签字。",
   "spoken": "以前去银航，每笔转账都要本人签字。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 16.328,
   "dur": 3.984,
   "speechStart": 16.426,
   "speechEnd": 19.461
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "现在你可以签一份授权书，允许助理每天替你付 100 元以内的账单。",
   "spoken": "现在你可以签一份授权书，允许助理每天替你付 100 元以内的账单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 20.532,
   "dur": 5.328,
   "speechStart": 20.63,
   "speechEnd": 25.023
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "授权书让生活方便很多。",
   "spoken": "授权书让生活方便很多。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 26.08,
   "dur": 2.808,
   "speechStart": 26.178,
   "speechEnd": 28.047
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "可如果签的是，允许持有人处理我全部财产，后果比签错一笔转账严重得多。",
   "spoken": "可如果签的是，允许持有人楚理我全部财产，后果比签错一笔转账严重得多。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 29.108,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 29.206,
   "speechEnd": 34.753
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "比喻不成立的地方是，纸质授权书要公证，也能去银行撤销。",
   "spoken": "比喻不成立的地方是，纸质授权书要公证，也能去银航撤销。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 35.808,
   "dur": 5.4,
   "speechStart": 35.906,
   "speechEnd": 40.37
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "链上的委托签名立刻生效，有时在多条链上同时生效。",
   "spoken": "链上的委托签名立刻生效，有时在多条链上同时生效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 41.428,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 41.526,
   "speechEnd": 45.895
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "新流程里有哪些角色？先看 ERC-4337。",
   "spoken": "新流程里有哪些决色？先看 ERC-4337。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 46.952,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 47.05,
   "speechEnd": 51.428
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "用户不直接发交易，而是提交一个用户操作，UserOperation。",
   "spoken": "用户不直接发交易，而是提交一个用户操作，UserOperation。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 52.476,
   "dur": 5.208,
   "speechStart": 52.574,
   "speechEnd": 56.836
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "Bundler 是打包者，把很多个用户操作，打包成一笔链上交易。",
   "spoken": "Bundler 是打包者，把很多个用户操作，打包成一笔链上交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 57.904,
   "dur": 4.944,
   "speechStart": 58.002,
   "speechEnd": 62.002
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "EntryPoint 是统一的入口合约，它先验证，再执行。",
   "spoken": "EntryPoint 是统一的入口合约，它先验证，再执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 63.068,
   "dur": 4.944,
   "speechStart": 63.166,
   "speechEnd": 67.189
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "第一步，问智能账户，签名对不对。",
   "spoken": "第一步，问智能账户，签名对不对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 68.232,
   "dur": 3.744,
   "speechStart": 68.33,
   "speechEnd": 71.139
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "第二步，问 Paymaster，愿不愿意替用户付 Gas。",
   "spoken": "第二步，问 Paymaster，愿不愿意替用户付 Gas。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 72.196,
   "dur": 4.968,
   "speechStart": 72.294,
   "speechEnd": 76.341
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "两步都通过，才执行用户要做的调用，最后结算 Gas。",
   "spoken": "两步都通过，才执行用户要做的掉用，最后结算 Gas。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 77.384,
   "dur": 5.088,
   "speechStart": 77.482,
   "speechEnd": 81.648
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "验证和执行，被拆成了两步。",
   "spoken": "验证和执行，被拆成了两步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 82.692,
   "dur": 3.24,
   "speechStart": 82.79,
   "speechEnd": 85.111
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "每一步的边界，都可能出错。",
   "spoken": "每一步的边界，都可能出错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
